{"html": "<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Battle_Reimagined-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><br>Experiência de combate pioneira e com proporções míticas focada em embates multijogador de curta distância em que a movimentação assume grande importância.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/技能展示.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/分割线.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Agile_Swordplay-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><br>Combate corpo a corpo violento e poético, com batalhas brutais entre jogadores munidos de katanas e montantes, arcos e mosquetes, habilidades heroicas e habilidades supremas.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/乒乓乒乓.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/分割线.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Travel_Beyond_Limits-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br>Desloque-se com extrema velocidade usando seu arpéu. Use-o para percorrer desde a montanha mais alta ou lançar-se na direção de um adversário desavisado.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/飞索.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/分割线.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Untold_Power-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br>Personalize e domine um rol cada vez maior de heróis lendários, cada um com habilidades heroicas, habilidades supremas e estilos de jogo letais próprios.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/技能展示1027.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/分割线.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Kingdom_in_ruins-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br>Explore a Ilha de Morus: um campo de batalha misterioso, deslumbrante, devastado pela guerra e cuja estética marcante é inspirada nas lendas e na história do Extremo Oriente.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/场景__2_.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/分割线.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/Adapt_Or_Die-Braz.jpg?t=1737540792\" /><br>Aprenda e jogue cada vez melhor num campo de batalha em constante evolução com vários outros jogadores. Encare Duelos 1x1, Brigas na Arena e até batalhas entre 60 jogadores com mecânicas exclusivas de ressurreição e do Dragão Celeste.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/水车.gif?t=1737540792\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203220/extras/blue.png?t=1737540792\" />"}